WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:16.109
Angela Merkel is the most astonishing
and successful political survivor in

00:00:16.109 --> 00:00:42.260
Germany since reunification

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:49.290
Angela Merkel always want the people
around her, those who work with her to be

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:55.800
very, very loyal, and not to talk to the
media by their own. Whoever breaks this

00:00:55.800 --> 00:01:06.180
unwritten law will be thrown out
immediately

00:01:13.829 --> 00:01:17.320
It was quite clear, she had to take the decision to throw him out

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:27.880
because she wants to
show her authority towards him

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:34.810
Angela Merkel started in 1990 at the
cabinet of Helmut Kohl.  She was a

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:42.700
very, very good observer; she listened
carefully and she learned a lot

00:01:42.700 --> 00:02:13.110
just from observing how Helmut Kohl is
doing politics

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:23.320
when she dared to write the important
letter, an open letter, published in a big

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:30.640
German newspaper, where she said goodbye
to "the old horse" as she wrote, Helmut Kohl

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:36.910
Yeah that was a big strategy but it
came out to be true and it helped

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:45.969
her to achieve the presidency of the
party

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:53.730
she had the feeling that the
demands of society do not really

00:02:53.730 --> 00:03:02.110
correspond any more with the program of the CDU. 
So she modernized her party in

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:09.660
an extraordinary way

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:34.120
she adapted the program of her party to
the needs of society, and a little less to

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:37.707
the needs of her party.

00:03:37.707 --> 00:03:45.660
she keeps calm
and carries on which means she's not

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:56.430
intimidated by anything

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:05.940
Angela Merkel - everybody knows it - is
afraid of dogs

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:15.300
and she was like freezing but
she didn't show her fear and this is very

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:22.889
typical for her, she faces any situation
without showing her emotions or very

00:04:22.889 --> 00:04:26.330
very few emotions

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:35.620
German people do have a lot of
confidence in Angela Merkel and one

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:42.309
point why they do have this confidence
is because Angela Merkel is leading a

00:04:42.309 --> 00:04:51.640
very very modest, private life so she is
regarded as being incorruptible

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:00.320
 

